<speech id="uk.org.publicwhip/westminhall/2014-09-08a.185.0" speakerid="uk.org.publicwhip/member/40495" speakername="Karen Lumley" colnum="185"  time="016:50:00" url="http://www.publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm201415/cmhansrd/cm140908/halltext/140908h0001.htm#140908h0001.htm_spnew19">
	<p pid="a.185.0/1">I congratulate my hon. Friend on securing the debate. Does he think that we need to follow the example given us by the e-petition to educate our constituents? Should we not take part in prostate cancer awareness month in November to help raise awareness of this killer disease in all our constituencies?</p>
</speech>
